    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>The complex numbers z and w are given by z = 3 + 4i and w = 1 − 2i.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find zw.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">z</span><span class=\"frac__d\">w</span></span> in the form a + bi, where a and b are real.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">3 − 6i + 4i − 8i<sup>2</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= 11 − 2i</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Multiplies numerator and denominator by 1 + 2i</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">(3 + 4i)(1 + 2i)</span><span class=\"frac__d\">5</span></span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">−5 + 10i</span><span class=\"frac__d\">5</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= −1 + 2i</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
