    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>The matrix <strong>A</strong> has rows (2, 1) and (5, 3).</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find det <strong>A</strong>.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find <strong>A</strong><sup>−1</sup>.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Hence solve the simultaneous equations 2x + y = 4 and 5x + 3y = 11.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">det <strong>A</strong> = 6 − 5 = 1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">B1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\"><strong>A</strong><sup>−1</sup> has rows (3, −1) and (−5, 2)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1 A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Multiplies <strong>A</strong><sup>−1</sup> by the column vector (4, 11)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">x = 1, y = 2</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
