    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>The cubic equation 2x<sup>3</sup> − 4x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 5 = 0 has roots α, β and γ.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Write down the values of α + β + γ, αβ + βγ + γα and αβγ.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find the value of α<sup>2</sup> + β<sup>2</sup> + γ<sup>2</sup>.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find a cubic equation with integer coefficients whose roots are 2α, 2β and 2γ.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Sum = 2, sum of products in pairs = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">3</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span>, product = −<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">5</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">B1 B1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">(α + β + γ)<sup>2</sup> − 2(αβ + βγ + γα) = 4 − 3</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= 1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Substitutes x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">w</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">w<sup>3</sup></span><span class=\"frac__d\">4</span></span> − w<sup>2</sup> + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">3w</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> + 5 = 0</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">w<sup>3</sup> − 4w<sup>2</sup> + 6w + 20 = 0</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
