    "content": {
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Prove by induction that, for all positive integers n, the sum of r(r + 1) from r = 1 to n is equal to <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">n(n + 1)(n + 2)</span><span class=\"frac__d\">3</span></span>.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(6)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">n = 1: LHS = 2 and RHS = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1 × 2 × 3</span><span class=\"frac__d\">3</span></span> = 2, so true for n = 1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">B1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Assumes the result is true for n = k</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Adds the (k + 1)th term: <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">k(k + 1)(k + 2)</span><span class=\"frac__d\">3</span></span> + (k + 1)(k + 2)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">(k + 1)(k + 2)(k + 3)</span><span class=\"frac__d\">3</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">This is the result with n = k + 1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">True for n = 1, and true for n = k implies true for n = k + 1, so true for all positive integers n</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
  {
