    "content": {
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Starting from the definitions of sinh x and cosh x in terms of exponentials, prove that cosh<sup>2</sup> x − sinh<sup>2</sup> x = 1.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Solve the equation 2cosh<sup>2</sup> x − 3sinh x = 1, giving your answers as exact logarithms.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(5)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">cosh<sup>2</sup> x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">e<sup>2x</sup> + 2 + e<sup>−2x</sup></span><span class=\"frac__d\">4</span></span> and sinh<sup>2</sup> x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">e<sup>2x</sup> − 2 + e<sup>−2x</sup></span><span class=\"frac__d\">4</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1 A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Subtracts to obtain <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">4</span><span class=\"frac__d\">4</span></span> = 1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Uses cosh<sup>2</sup> x = 1 + sinh<sup>2</sup> x: 2sinh<sup>2</sup> x − 3sinh x + 1 = 0</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">(2sinh x − 1)(sinh x − 1) = 0</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">sinh x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> or sinh x = 1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">x = ln(1 + √2)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">x = ln <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1 + √5</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
