    "content": {
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">The curve C has polar equation r = 2(1 + cos θ), 0 ≤ θ &lt; 2π. Find the exact area enclosed by C.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(6)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Area = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> ∫ r<sup>2</sup> dθ = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> ∫ 4(1 + cos θ)<sup>2</sup> dθ from 0 to 2π</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Expands: 1 + 2cos θ + cos<sup>2</sup> θ</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Uses cos<sup>2</sup> θ = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span>(1 + cos 2θ)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">2[<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">3θ</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> + 2sin θ + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">sin 2θ</span><span class=\"frac__d\">4</span></span>] from 0 to 2π</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1 A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Area = 6π</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
  {
