      "question_html": "<p>The integral I<sub>n</sub> is defined as the integral of sin<sup>n</sup> x from x = 0 to x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">π</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span>, for integers n ≥ 0.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Show that I<sub>n</sub> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">n − 1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">n</span></span> I<sub>n−2</sub> for n ≥ 2.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(6)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Hence find the exact value of I<sub>6</sub>.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Writes sin<sup>n</sup> x = sin<sup>n−1</sup> x × sin x and integrates by parts</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">[−sin<sup>n−1</sup> x cos x] + (n − 1)∫ sin<sup>n−2</sup> x cos<sup>2</sup> x dx</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">The bracket is zero at both limits</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">B1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Uses cos<sup>2</sup> x = 1 − sin<sup>2</sup> x</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">I<sub>n</sub> = (n − 1)I<sub>n−2</sub> − (n − 1)I<sub>n</sub></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">nI<sub>n</sub> = (n − 1)I<sub>n−2</sub>, giving the result</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">I<sub>0</sub> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">π</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">B1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">I<sub>6</sub> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">5</span><span class=\"frac__d\">6</span></span> × <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">3</span><span class=\"frac__d\">4</span></span> × <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> × <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">π</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">5π</span><span class=\"frac__d\">32</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
