    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>The complex number z satisfies |z| = 1 and z ≠ −1. Let w = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">z − 1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">z + 1</span></span>.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Show that the real part of w is zero.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(5)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Interpret this result geometrically, referring to the points representing −1, 1 and z on an Argand diagram.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Considers w + w*, where * denotes the complex conjugate</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">(z − 1)(z* + 1) + (z* − 1)(z + 1)</span><span class=\"frac__d\">(z + 1)(z* + 1)</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Numerator = 2zz* − 2</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Uses zz* = |z|<sup>2</sup> = 1, so the numerator is 0</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">w + w* = 0, so Re(w) = 0</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">arg w is the angle between the lines joining z to 1 and z to −1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">w is purely imaginary, so this angle is a right angle</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">The angle in a semicircle on the diameter from −1 to 1 is 90°</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  }
]
